LSToast uses LSTPopView as an automatically resolved external dependency:
https://github.com/LoSenTrad/LSTPopView

CocoaPods selects the original Objective-C LSTPopView pod (MIT, with LSTTimer).
Swift Package Manager and Carthage select its native LSTPopViewSwift module (MIT).
The upstream repository contains the respective copyright and license notices.
No upstream popup engine sources are vendored into this library.
